### ============================================================================
### TWO-FACTOR AUTHENTICATION (2FA) TESTING
### ============================================================================
### File ini berisi contoh request untuk testing fitur 2FA Email-based OTP
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@contentType = application/json

# Variables - Update setelah mendapat response
@accessToken = your-access-token-here
@userId = your-user-id-here
@otpCode = your-otp-code-from-email

### ============================================================================
### FLOW 1: ENABLE 2FA (User harus login dulu)
### ============================================================================

### 1.1. Login Normal (untuk dapat accessToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "afriza.hrp@gmail.com",
  "password": "1234567"
}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "user": { ... },
###   "accessToken": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "refreshToken": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "sessionId": "...",
###   "message": "Login successful"
### }
###
### COPY accessToken ke variable @accessToken di atas

### ============================================================================

### 1.2. Check 2FA Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa-status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "userId": 123,
###   "email": "afriza.hrp@gmail.com",
###   "twoFactorEnabled": false
### }

### ============================================================================

### 1.3. Enable 2FA
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/enable-2fa
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "message": "Two-factor authentication enabled successfully",
###   "twoFactorEnabled": true
### }

### ============================================================================

### 1.4. Check 2FA Status Lagi (harus true sekarang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa-status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "userId": 123,
###   "email": "afriza.hrp@gmail.com",
###   "twoFactorEnabled": true  // ← Sekarang true!
### }

### ============================================================================
### FLOW 2: LOGIN DENGAN 2FA ENABLED
### ============================================================================

### 2.1. Logout dulu
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================================================

### 2.2. Login dengan 2FA Enabled
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "afriza.hrp@gmail.com",
  "password": "1234567",
  "deviceName": "Chrome Desktop"
}

### Expected Response (BEDA dari login normal!):
### {
###   "requires2FA": true,
###   "userId": 123,
###   "message": "Two-factor authentication required. Please check your email for the OTP code."
### }
###
### ⚠️ TIDAK ADA accessToken! 
### ⚠️ System kirim OTP ke email
### ⚠️ CHECK EMAIL untuk 6-digit code
###
### COPY userId ke variable @userId di atas

### ============================================================================

### 2.3. Check Email - Akan terima email dengan 6-digit OTP
### Subject: "Kode Verifikasi Login - Ngebengkel"
### Content: 6-digit code seperti "123456"
###
### COPY OTP code ke variable @otpCode di atas

### ============================================================================

### 2.4. Verify OTP dan Complete Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-2fa
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "otpCode": "{{otpCode}}",
  "deviceName": "Chrome Desktop"
}

### Expected Success Response:
### {
###   "user": { ... },
###   "accessToken": "eyJhbGc...",  // ← Dapat token setelah OTP verified
###   "refreshToken": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "sessionId": "...",
###   "message": "Login successful with 2FA"
### }
###
### Expected Error Response (OTP salah):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "Invalid or expired OTP code"
### }
###
### Expected Error Response (OTP expired):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "Invalid or expired OTP code"
### }

### ============================================================================
### FLOW 3: DISABLE 2FA
### ============================================================================

### 3.1. Login (dengan 2FA - ikuti Flow 2 di atas)
### Atau gunakan accessToken yang masih valid

### ============================================================================

### 3.2. Disable 2FA
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/disable-2fa
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "message": "Two-factor authentication disabled successfully",
###   "twoFactorEnabled": false
### }

### ============================================================================

### 3.3. Check 2FA Status (harus false sekarang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa-status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "userId": 123,
###   "email": "afriza.hrp@gmail.com",
###   "twoFactorEnabled": false  // ← Kembali false
### }

### ============================================================================

### 3.4. Login Normal Lagi (tanpa OTP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "afriza.hrp@gmail.com",
  "password": "1234567"
}

### Expected Response (kembali normal, dapat accessToken langsung):
### {
###   "user": { ... },
###   "accessToken": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "refreshToken": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "sessionId": "...",
###   "message": "Login successful"
### }

### ============================================================================
### TESTING SCENARIOS
### ============================================================================

### Scenario 1: OTP Code Expired (tunggu 10+ menit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-2fa
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "otpCode": "123456",
  "deviceName": "Test"
}

### Expected: 401 - Invalid or expired OTP code

### ============================================================================

### Scenario 2: Invalid OTP Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-2fa
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "otpCode": "999999",
  "deviceName": "Test"
}

### Expected: 401 - Invalid or expired OTP code

### ============================================================================

### Scenario 3: Missing userId
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-2fa
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "otpCode": "123456"
}

### Expected: 401 - User ID and OTP code are required

### ============================================================================

### Scenario 4: Missing OTP Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-2fa
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 123
}

### Expected: 401 - User ID and OTP code are required

### ============================================================================
### COMPLETE TESTING WORKFLOW
### ============================================================================
###
### 1. ✅ Register user baru atau login dengan user existing
### 2. ✅ Enable 2FA via /auth/enable-2fa
### 3. ✅ Logout
### 4. ✅ Login lagi - akan dapat response requires2FA=true
### 5. ✅ Check email untuk OTP code
### 6. ✅ Verify OTP via /auth/verify-2fa dengan OTP code
### 7. ✅ Login berhasil dengan accessToken
### 8. ✅ Test disable 2FA via /auth/disable-2fa
### 9. ✅ Login lagi - langsung dapat accessToken (no OTP)
###
### ============================================================================

